@startuml
left to right direction

actor "Leitor" as Reader
actor "Bibliotecário" as Librarian

rectangle "LMS API\nSpring Boot 3.2" as LMS

cloud "Google Books" as Google
cloud "Open Library" as OpenLibrary
cloud "SMTP" as SMTP
cloud "Gateway SMS" as SMS
cloud "Webhook" as Webhook

Reader --> LMS : consulta\nempréstimos/políticas
Librarian --> LMS : gestão de livros,\nleitores e empréstimos
LMS --> Google : ISBN lookup
LMS --> OpenLibrary : ISBN lookup
LMS --> SMTP : email
LMS --> SMS : SMS
LMS --> Webhook : evento JSON

note right of LMS
  A aplicação mantém o modelo de biblioteca
  e delega fontes externas e notificações
  em portas/adaptadores.
end note

@enduml
